entation\" data-lc-zh=\"组件变体、使用规范与交接文档\" >Component variants, usage guidelines and handoff documentation</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#lc-section-states\" data-lc-index-link><svg class=\"lc-deliverable-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 4-4 7-8 9-4-2-8-5-8-9V6Z\"/><path d=\"M12 8v5m0 3h.01\"/></svg><span>Boundary-state examples</span></a></td><td>Loading, no data, errors, long text and permission restrictions</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#lc-section-international\" data-lc-index-link><svg class=\"lc-deliverable-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"4\" ry=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg><span>Internationalization and accessibility</span></a></td><td>Multiple currencies, local formats, keyboard access and RTL</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-components\">React + TypeScript page and components</strong>",
      "<p>A dense ledger needs a clear scan path and a predictable way to inspect a record. The page composes Button, Input, Select, FilterBar, MoneyText, StatusBadge, TransactionTable and TransactionDrawer instead of implementing each state separately.</p>",
      "<p>Implementation: src/App.tsx owns filters, currency-grouped sorting, request states and selection. Components live in src/components/. On narrow screens, the table scrolls inside a labelled region; the details drawer supports keyboard focus and return. The TypeScript/Vite build produces a standalone Ledger Console.html for review.</p>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-tokens\">Design tokens</strong>",
      "<p>Design tokens define color, type, spacing, radius and motion. tokens/tokens.json generates CSS and typed references; light-theme overrides remain in themes.css.</p>",
