      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"tokens\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-tokens\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 02</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Adjust the design tokens\" data-lc-zh=\"调整设计令牌\" id=\"lc-example-heading-tokens\">Adjust the design tokens</h3><p data-lc-en=\"Change color, radius and spacing; test the preview action.\" data-lc-zh=\"调整颜色、圆角与间距，再点击预览按钮。\" >Change color, radius and spacing; test the preview action.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/examples.html?example=tokens&amp;lang=en\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 02: Adjust the design tokens\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 02: Adjust the design tokens\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 02：调整设计令牌\" data-lc-example=\"tokens\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-storybook\">Storybook and component documentation</strong>",
      "<p data-lc-en=\"Explore component variants, states and themes in Storybook. Change the amount or currency to see the format update.\" data-lc-zh=\"在 Storybook 中查看组件变体、状态与主题。调整金额或币种，即时查看格式变化。\" >Explore component variants, states and themes in Storybook. Change the amount or currency to see the format update.</p>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"storybook\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-section-storybook\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption lc-example-caption--compact\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 03</span><a href=\"projects/ledger-console/storybook/index.html?path=/docs/components-moneytext--docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span data-lc-en=\"Open Storybook ↗\" data-lc-zh=\"打开 Storybook ↗\" >Open Storybook ↗</span></a></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/storybook/iframe.html?id=components-moneytext--interactive&amp;viewMode=story&amp;globals=theme:light\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 03: Explore component variants\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 03: Explore component variants\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 03：浏览组件变体\" data-lc-example=\"storybook\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>",
      "<section class=\"lc-money-notes\" data-ledger-money-notes aria-labelledby=\"lc-money-notes-title\">\n  <h3 data-lc-en=\"Four details behind MoneyText\" data-lc-zh=\"金额展示的四个细节\" id=\"lc-money-notes-title\">Four details behind MoneyText</h3>\n  <dl>\n    <div><dt data-lc-en=\"ISO currency codes\" data-lc-zh=\"ISO 币种代码\" >ISO currency codes</dt><dd><span data-lc-en=\"Codes distinguish currencies that share a symbol.\" data-lc-zh=\"用标准代码区分使用相同符号的币种。\" >Codes distinguish currencies that share a symbol.</span><code>USD 100.00 ≠ HKD 100.00</code></dd></div>\n    <div><dt data-lc-en=\"Local formats\" data-lc-zh=\"本地格式\" >Local formats</dt><dd><span data-lc-en=\"Separators and decimal places follow the locale and currency.\" data-lc-zh=\"分隔符与小数位随地区和币种调整。\" >Separators and decimal places follow the locale and currency.</span><code>GBP 1,234.50 · JPY 1,234 · KWD 12.345</code></dd></div>\n    <div><dt data-lc-en=\"Invalid amounts\" data-lc-zh=\"无效金额\" >Invalid amounts</dt><dd><span data-lc-en=\"Invalid input shows a fallback instead of zero.\" data-lc-zh=\"无效输入显示占位提示，避免误认为零。\" >Invalid input shows a fallback instead of zero.</span><code><span data-lc-en=\"Empty input → Amount unavailable\" data-lc-zh=\"清空输入 → 金额不可用\" >Empty input → Amount unavailable</span></code></dd></div>\n    <div><dt data-lc-en=\"Bidirectional isolation\" data-lc-zh=\"双向文本隔离\" >Bidirectional isolation</dt><dd><span data-lc-en=\"Currency codes and numbers stay isolated inside RTL text.\" data-lc-zh=\"在从右向左的文字中隔离币种代码与数字。\" >Currency codes and numbers stay isolated inside RTL text.</span><code><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\">المبلغ <bdi dir=\"ltr\">AED 2,322.95</bdi></span></code></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n</section>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-states\">Boundary-state examples</strong>",
      "<p data-lc-en=\"Each example pairs a real interface state with a practical scenario. Try the available actions to see how a user can recover.\" data-lc-zh=\"每个示例将真实界面状态与具体场景放在一起，可试用操作查看恢复路径。\" >Each example pairs a real interface state with a practical scenario. Try the available actions to see how a user can recover.</p>",
      "<p data-lc-en=\"The examples cover loading, empty results, connection errors, access, expired sessions and long text. Recovery actions operate on local example data.\" data-lc-zh=\"示例涵盖加载、空数据、网络错误、权限、会话过期和长文本；恢复操作使用本地示例数据。\" >The examples cover loading, empty results, connection errors, access, expired sessions and long text. Recovery actions operate on local example data.</p>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"states\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-states\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 04</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Explore states and recovery\" data-lc-zh=\"查看状态与恢复\" id=\"lc-example-heading-states\">Explore states and recovery</h3><p data-lc-en=\"See each state alongside its example and try the recovery actions.\" data-lc-zh=\"对照说明查看每种状态，并试用恢复操作。\" >See each state alongside its example and try the recovery actions.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/examples.html?example=states&amp;lang=en\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 04: Explore states and recovery\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 04: Explore states and recovery\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 04：查看状态与恢复\" data-lc-example=\"states\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-international\">Internationalization and accessibility</strong>",
      "<p>The ledger supports English and Arabic, with automatic RTL when Arabic is selected. Currency codes remain explicit, numbers use the documented Latin-digit convention, bidirectional isolation protects identifiers, and dates are consistently labelled UTC. All six fixture currencies use two decimals; the MoneyText examples additionally exercise zero- and three-decimal formats.</p>",
      "<p>Keyboard support includes a skip link, visible focus, native controls, result-count announcements, Enter/Space to open a row, and a drawer with Tab containment, Escape and focus return. Core targets are at least 44px. docs/I18N_ACCESSIBILITY.md records the review matrix and remaining native-speaker and assistive-technology checks; no WCAG certification is claimed.</p>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"international\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-international\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 05</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access\" data-lc-zh=\"试用币种、RTL 与键盘操作\" id=\"lc-example-heading-international\">Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access</h3><p data-lc-en=\"Switch locale and currency, then open and close the drawer using the keyboard.\" data-lc-zh=\"切换语言与币种，再用键盘打开和关闭详情抽屉。\" >Switch locale and currency, then open and close the drawer using the keyboard.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/examples.html?example=international&amp;lang=en\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 05: Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 05: Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 05：试用币种、RTL 与键盘操作\" data-lc-example=\"international\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>"
    ]
